  --radius-card: 24px;
}
```
Note `--color-sage-dark` duplicates forest; okay. Use `--color-forest`.

Tailwind v4 utility names: `bg-canvas`, `text-ink`, `border-line`, `bg-sage/20`, etc. Good.

